---
// LineageSection Component: Pull any thread back to the row it came from
---

<section class="section-wrapper lineage-section" id="lineage">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="lineage-header">
      <span class="section-tag">03 · Lineage</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Pull any thread back to the row it came from.</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        An answer is only as good as the rows under it. Hover a line of the cloth and Warpyn lights the thread back through the reed to its source, the exact record and every step in between.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Lineage Interactive Explorer -->
    <div class="lineage-explorer">
      <!-- Left: The Answer Woven -->
      <div class="explorer-card answer-card">
        <div class="card-kicker">Woven Answer</div>
        <div class="answer-figure-row">
          <span class="figure-main">+38%</span>
          <span class="figure-context">Nordics ARR Q3</span>
        </div>
        <p class="answer-narrative">
          Nordics led growth at +38%, driven by 41 new mid-market accounts added between July and September.
        </p>

        <div class="step-lineage-flow">
          <div class="flow-node active">
            <span class="flow-num">1</span>
            <div class="flow-desc">
              <strong>Glossary Definition</strong>
              <span>net_arr_eur (confirmed by CFO 12 Aug)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-connector"></div>
          <div class="flow-node">
            <span class="flow-num">2</span>
            <div class="flow-desc">
              <strong>Query Plan</strong>
              <span>JOIN crm.accounts ON billing.invoices.customer_id</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-connector"></div>
          <div class="flow-node">
            <span class="flow-num">3</span>
            <div class="flow-desc">
              <strong>Source Row Verification</strong>
              <span>41 rows matched across Stripe & Salesforce</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Direct Row Inspector -->
      <div class="explorer-card rows-inspector">
        <div class="card-kicker">Row-Level Lineage</div>
        
        <div class="table-container">
          <table class="lineage-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Account</th>
                <th>Region</th>
                <th>Plan</th>
                <th>Invoice</th>
                <th>Amount</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="bold">NordicLogix AB</td>
                <td><span class="pill-tag">SE</span></td>
                <td>Enterprise</td>
                <td class="mono">inv_9841f</td>
                <td class="mono green">€14,200</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="bold">Helsinki Media Oy</td>
                <td><span class="pill-tag">FI</span></td>
                <td>Growth</td>
                <td class="mono">inv_9842a</td>
                <td class="mono green">€8,400</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="bold">Fjord Maritime AS</td>
                <td><span class="pill-tag">NO</span></td>
                <td>Enterprise</td>
                <td class="mono">inv_9843c</td>
                <td class="mono green">€22,500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="bold">Dansk Retail ApS</td>
                <td><span class="pill-tag">DK</span></td>
                <td>Growth</td>
                <td class="mono">inv_9844e</td>
                <td class="mono green">€9,100</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="audit-badge">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Auditable query plan stored · Raw data remains in your VPC</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lineage-header {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .lineage-explorer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .lineage-explorer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.25fr;
    }
  }

  .explorer-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .card-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .answer-figure-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .figure-main {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .figure-context {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .answer-narrative {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* Flow nodes */
  .step-lineage-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .flow-node {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .flow-node.active {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .flow-num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-tag);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .flow-node.active .flow-num {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .flow-desc strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .flow-desc span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .flow-connector {
    width: 2px;
    height: 12px;
    background: var(--border-strong);
    margin-left: 1.7rem;
  }

  /* Table */
  .table-container {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .lineage-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .lineage-table th {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .lineage-table td {
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17, 19, 23, 0.05);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .lineage-table td.bold {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .lineage-table td.mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .lineage-table td.green {
    color: #1a7f37;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pill-tag {
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bg-tag);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .audit-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(17, 19, 23, 0.04);
  }
</style>
